      "content": "it's not just about steps though. i've tried that. i've tried the counselors and the lists and the \"one step at a time\" thing. it doesn't matter. the math just doesn't work. i'm just running in place while the water gets higher. it feels like the only way to actually stop the feeling of being trapped is to just... stop. everything.",
